<title>USA: Kansas City, Mo., won by Lehman Brothers.</title>
<headline>Kansas City, Mo., won by Lehman Brothers.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said it won $29.415 million of Kansas City, Mo., general improvement airport refunding revenue bonds, Series 1997 A, with a true interest cost of 5.58 percent.</p>
</text>
